  "ch1.p3": "Benchmarking `sumLoop(100)` over 50,000 calls on this Apple arm64 machine (`--max-opt=0..3`) confirms the spread: capped at Ignition it takes 700 ns per call; Sparkplug drops to 286.3 ns; Maglev compiles in 0.062 ms on a background thread and hits 37.9 ns; TurboFan spends 0.456 ms to reach 34.5 ns. Compiling cold code upfront with TurboFan would waste 1.72 ms mostly inside the compiler, whereas V8's tiered path finishes the cold run in 0.053 ms.",
